Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think the matter is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm going to have to hear the Colonel's long-winded, snide remarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"You struck out on the\NPhilosopher's Stone at Liore, huh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Just how much of the military's budget\Nare you going to spend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,on this fool's errand\Nbefore you're satisfied?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Uh-oh, I don't see\NEdward-kun around."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I'm right here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:42.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Sorry, sorry, I didn't see you there\Nbehind my paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, like you said, we're here now, \Nso I guess I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:00:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.03,0:01:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Breda?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:28.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Havoc, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe it's a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A carnivorous canine. The scientific name is—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I was asking, Warrant Officer Falman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, Lt. Hawkeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.\NI found him this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Sgt. Fuery...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're keeping him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could, but as I'm sure you know, Lt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Havoc,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,animals are not permitted in the dormitories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't keep him here\Nin the office because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was shivering out in the rain, and I felt so sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will anyone else keep him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm also in the dorms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. I hate dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I guess I'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do like dogs, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear they're good \Nwhen stir-fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out here in the eastern country,\Nthey're raised for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The redder ones in particular—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's look for another master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, are you busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun, Alphonse-kun,\Nyou're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun, your report!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:59.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go see the Colonel directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have capacity\Nor the conditions to keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't just go around picking up animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:11.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he was shivering out in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can keep him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!\NGo drop him off\Nwhere you found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you idiot!\NYou're not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't run!\NThink about the poor cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:30.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you really did\Nquite a number on all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, the town of Liore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who gave me the information on the fake Philosopher's Stone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I never told you to drive\Nthe Minister from his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result, the town has come under the rule of the Eastern Command Center, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell me that's what\Nyou were after in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that in Xenotime, the great landowner Mugear has gone missing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that his mansion has collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Where was this Xenotime again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could get you to submit a report on the red water as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was also an inquiry from the police in the tourist resort of Aquroya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Psiren's\Nunmasked face is beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you're trying to say is that \Nyou can tell everything we do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal, why don't you try settling down already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:58.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me to become one of your toadies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:58.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We ourselves have a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's been three years,\Nand you still haven't found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll find it, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:22.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel, do you know \Nthe name Marcoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a doctor and an alchemist who showed up in Xenotime five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:33.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he cured the poisoning caused by the red water,\Nsomething no one else could cure, with some kind of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:38.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured that the military would at least know the name of someone that skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't recall it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I will check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an unexpected pleasure, Brigadier General.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As of today, we'll be using this office as a temporary Central Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A temporary Central Command Center?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a hassle this must be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, at ease, at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Führer, your Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Henceforth, His Excellency the Führer,\Nand the chief command personnel under him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will be observing the Eastern Region.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at all those chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are the silver watches that\Nshow that they're State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means that everyone here is a State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elicia can ride a tricycle now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She follows me around everywhere like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the same as ever, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got more. Wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know, if you're going to come see us, you could've said something ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:09.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wanted to see the surprised look on Mustang's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm a Lt. Colonel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge of investigations at the Court-Martial Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:18.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you should be in Central, shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of the prominent bigwigs are \Ntrying to run away from Central—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean—never mind.\NEr, how have you been doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We might be getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:35.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm searching for\Na man named Doctor Marcoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the Colonel\Nwon't tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he\Njust doesn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, that bastard is definitely hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just said "Marcoh," didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brigadier General Grand...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Iron Blood Alchemist...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:10:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By "Marcoh,"\Ndo you mean the deserter Marcoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Six years ago, many State Alchemists\Nwere called up to the Eastern Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, Marcoh deserted the battlefield before it came to an end
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and has been missing ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deserter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.73,0:10:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor Marcoh... Doctor Marcoh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, all records of him\Nhave been erased!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this point, I guess I'll just have to \Nflatten the Colonel and beat it out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flatten him, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you still...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, it hasn't stopped raining yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo! I forgot to mention\Nsomething important earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because of the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this year's assessments will temporarily be held here rather than at Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assessments?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean the assessments to renew certifications for State Alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:10:59.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know later about the provisions and such—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:00.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have a way I'd like to try handling the assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Battle assessment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The alchemist conducts a mock battle,\Nand the contest itself is what gets assessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Edward himself\Nrequested to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's more, he nominated the Colonel to go against?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:36.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, if they went at it seriously,\Nwhich one do you think is stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'd be the Colonel, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, you can't take\NFullmetal too lightly, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:47.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when you think about the stories of the Colonel's activities during the Eastern Rebellion...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:50.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would Edward-san propose such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that he gave the\Ncondition that if he won,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Colonel would have to keep a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:02.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we can't have \Nthe Colonel take this guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.97,0:12:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are loyal above all else!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They follow their master's orders unconditionally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treat them cruelly,\Nand they don't complain!\NAnd they don't require a salary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed, they are servants to mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.07,0:12:31.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How nice! I love dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Colonel, are you \Ngoing to accept Edward's challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't very well go\Nall-out against a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will be a shame that I cannot display my true valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will permit this battle assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can use the entire parade grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That way, we won't have to worry about damage to the surrounding area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:13:00.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not as though you\Nweren't sure of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on, fight the Fullmetal Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For now, I'm just going to\Ndutifully obey their words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least until I achieve the rank of Führer and gain absolute power over the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you might want to be more discreet about such inappropriate declarations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, what could your purpose be in saying something so presumptuous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I become Führer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,all female military personnel will wear miniskirts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel! I will follow you to the ends of the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:56.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Eastern\NCommand Center Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And incidentally, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my daughter,\Nwho turned three this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elicia! Elicia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, we'll move directly to today's main event!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the red corner,\Nthe Flame Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.69,0:14:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roy Mustang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You ogre!\NOnly get yourself promoted, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:34.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Return my girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the blue corner,\Nthe Fullmetal Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.95,0:14:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:44.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's so small!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he a grade-schooler?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, bean sprout!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Small?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me small!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:52.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today is a great day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when I bust the Colonel's\Npompous mug in front of everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:15:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Brother,\Nwe're indebted to the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's overworked me, \Nsaying he'd let our secret out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what's your strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pop him with my fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The assessment doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I win, you're giving me your\Ninformation on Doctor Marcoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That, and you're\Ntaking care of the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fight!\NYou're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me some warning, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"A soldier favors foolish haste above cleverness."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means press the battle quickly, and end the battle quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those flames are\Nappearing out of thin air!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:55.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is the first time you've seen the Colonel do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.15,0:15:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His right glove is made of a special fabric,\Ncalled ignition cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you rub it hard, it creates sparks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for him to adjust the density of oxygen in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:07.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and "boom!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure is hard to hit \Nsuch a small target!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me small!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.39,0:16:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"If your opponent is of choleric temper,\Nseek to irritate him."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for the enemy's taunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I overdid it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you can't shoot\Nany more flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:56.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"All war is deception." Even sneak attacks make for worthy strategy, Fullmetal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need not even ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:44.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a magnificent fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:50.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are honored by\Nyour words of praise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:52.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on!\NWe're not through yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm,\Nbut if you go any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it will be tougher to\Ntidy up afterward, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:10.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've got no choice. Both of them were ordered to fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is why I didn't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel, why did you hold back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your last shot—\Nyou should've had the timing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This goes back many years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there was something\Ncalled the Ishbalan Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the east, when the Ishbalans clashed with the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw... many unpleasant things...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor Marcoh,\Nwho deserted the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was the most sensible man among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still think so, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that why you kept quiet about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, perhaps you ought to see Marcoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel, I still haven't heard the reason why you stopped on that last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah,\Nnever mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there are no other\Ncandidates to keep him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, just because you're relieved...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My discipline is strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on now, the bathroom is over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got that, Black Hayate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Black Hayate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About the town of Liore,\Nin Ed's report...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know that General Hakuro's detachment had been dispatched there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear there's a terrible\Ncivil war going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed wrote that the Minister had fallen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.61,0:20:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that the people would likely open their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.57,0:20:48.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Minister is doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand he's inciting the citizens to wage war against the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't be sure whether or not it's the same minister that Ed defeated, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to send Ed in again to investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He believes he's saved a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can let him believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll find out on his own sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've gotten the information on Marcoh from the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't very well ask him to take care of this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would go against the\NPrinciple of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but right now,\Nthis is all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not here to observe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:49.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The bigwigs conned the Führer\Ninto fleeing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In Central alone, there are already five State Alchemists and staff
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,East City...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.49,0:23:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:42.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 14: "Destruction's Right Hand"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if all of the State Alchemists are your enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:50.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't allow you to kill Brother!
